  "reason": "All screenshots show that imagery dominates visually without overwhelming text legibility. Titles and prose remain clearly readable on both phone and desktop, with large, high-contrast serif typography. The vertical Perspective menus are image-led with every perspective labeled and visually distinct, all complete without clipped or missing elements. Factual scenes use restrained serif type over visible images, maintaining clarity of both image and text. The geographical PLACE view is contiguous with strong visual consistency. Labels cleanly separate facts from contextual illustration, and every mobile screenshot shows clean composition with no clipped text or dead image space. No material visual issues are present.",
